          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فطرت — fitrat — \"a person's nature; disposition\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اس کی فطرت بڑی نرم ہے۔ us kī fitrat baṛī narm hai. She has a very gentle nature."
